Intl.NumberFormat for percent after a tool call.
-- script.js --
const r = mcp.stats.get({});
const pct = new Intl.NumberFormat("en-US", {style: "percent", maximumFractionDigits: 1});
return pct.format(r.ratio);
-- tools.json --
{
  "stats.get": {
    "ratio": 0.1234
  }
}
-- divergence --
Goja has no Intl (ReferenceError: Intl is not defined); the native engine formats "12.3%" as Node/ICU does.
